{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buko Boko is an incremental game with multiple ways to play and progress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tokens by playing mini-games. Use tokens to purchase new games, upgrades, and token multipliers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many upgrades to purchase!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803390/extras/e606493a37bab7aaedd79a437ac3dd28.poster.avif?t=1756460405\" width=530 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803390/extras/e606493a37bab7aaedd79a437ac3dd28.webm?t=1756460405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803390/extras/e606493a37bab7aaedd79a437ac3dd28.mp4?t=1756460405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is<strong> NOT</strong>\u00a0an Idle game. You will have to maintain combo multipliers to maximize your token gain. Unlock and complete all challenges to complete the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803390/extras/dcde952db87238591ebd5f123b66de7c.poster.avif?t=1756460405\" width=504 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803390/extras/dcde952db87238591ebd5f123b66de7c.webm?t=1756460405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803390/extras/dcde952db87238591ebd5f123b66de7c.mp4?t=1756460405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app